      "judgment_rationale": "Blackboard and the workspace-to-Blackboard redirect form one audited project capability. Web provides execution diagnostics plus list/create/update/delete for discussion posts and replies and post pin/unpin under tenant/project/workspace scope; workspace members read and workspace editors mutate. Cloud Desktop's single production WorkspaceCollaborationCanvas exposes Goals, Discussion, Status, Collaboration, Members, Genes, Files, Notes, Topology and Settings. Its HTTP client reads objectives, tasks, diagnostics, posts and replies, Agent and member rosters, Genes, files, workspace notes/settings and topology through the canonical collaboration authority, while visible controls create objectives/tasks/posts/replies, pin posts, add/remove members, update Genes, create/delete topology nodes and edges, and update the workspace through the versioned collaboration mutation endpoint. Reads require workspace membership, ordinary mutations require editor authority and member changes require owner authority. Protocol mutations without a production control remain excluded. The Local sidecar implements the plan snapshot only, so Local remains read-only partial."
    }
  ],
